ine100","quote":"彭城穆王權，字子輿，宣帝弟魏魯相東武城侯馗之子也。初襲封，拜冗從僕射。武帝受禪，封彭城王，邑二千九百戶。出為北中郎將、都督鄴城守諸軍事。泰始中入朝，賜袞冕之服。咸甯元年薨，子元王植立。歷位後將軍，尋拜國子祭酒、太僕卿、侍中、尚書。出為安東將軍、都督揚州諸軍事，代淮南王允鎮壽春，未發。或云植助允攻趙王倫，遂以憂薨。贈車騎將軍，增封萬五千戶。子康王釋立，官至南中郎將、持節、平南將軍，分魯國蕃、薛二縣以益其國，心二萬三千戶。薨，子雄立，坐奔蘇峻伏誅，更以釋子紘嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:line100:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:line100:m0020"}],"interpretation_note":"父子從本段具名王系及子詞建立；嗣紘的父親明載為釋，非雄。不推生母、排行或未知年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-phase5-037-植-father-權","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADAA","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子元王植立","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu-037-phase5","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:line100","quote":"彭城穆王權，字子輿，宣帝弟魏魯相東武城侯馗之子也。初襲封，拜冗從僕射。武帝受禪，封彭城王，邑二千九百戶。出為北中郎將、都督鄴城守諸軍事。泰始中入朝，賜袞冕之服。咸甯元年薨，子元王植立。歷位後將軍，尋拜國子祭酒、太僕卿、侍中、尚書。出為安東將軍、都督揚州諸軍事，代淮南王允鎮壽春，未發。或云植助允攻趙王倫，遂以憂薨。贈車騎將軍，增封萬五千戶。子康王釋立，官至南中郎將、持節、平南將軍，分魯國蕃、薛二縣以益其國，心二萬三千戶。薨，子雄立，坐奔蘇峻伏誅，更以釋子紘嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:line100:m0087","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:line100:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"父子從本段具名王系及子詞建立；嗣紘的父親明載為釋，非雄。不推生母、排行或未知年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jin037-near-001","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADB","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"彭城穆王權之弟","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"fixed_jin037_near_family","contract_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/source-contract.json"},"relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADA","younger_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADB","operator":"lt","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"scope":"siblings"}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p001","quote":"高密文獻王泰，字子舒，彭城穆王權之弟，魏陽亭侯，補陽翟令，遷扶風太守。武帝受禪，封隴西王，邑三千二百戶，拜遊擊將軍。出為兗州刺史，加鷹揚將軍。遷使持節、都督甯益二州諸軍事、安西將軍，領益州刺史，稱疾不行。轉安北將軍，代兄權督鄴城守事。安西將軍、都督關中事。太康初，入為散騎常侍、前將軍，領鄴城門校尉，以疾去官。後代下邳王晃為尚書左僕射。出為鎮西將軍，領護西戎校尉、假節，代扶風王駿都督關中軍事，以疾還京師。永熙初，代石鑒為司空，尋領太子太保。及楊駿誅，泰領駿營，加侍中，給步兵二千五百人，騎五百匹。泰固辭，乃給千兵百騎。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p001:m0011"}],"interpretation_note":"本完整收到單元原詞與雙人物錨；不由列表補絕對排行或同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jin037-near-016","subject_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADC","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADA","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"彭城王權季弟","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"fixed_jin037_near_family","contract_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/source-contract.json"},"relative_birth_order":{"older_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADA","younger_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADC","operator":"lt","older_ordinal":null,"younger_ordinal":null,"scope":"siblings"},"source_reported_position":{"scope":"brothers","position":"youngest","ordinal":null}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p011","quote":"范陽康王綏，字子都，彭城王權季弟也，初為諫議大夫。泰始元年受封，在位十五年。咸寧五年薨，子虓立焉。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p011:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p011:m0010"}],"interpretation_note":"本完整收到單元原詞與雙人物錨；不由列表補絕對排行或同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","or