維基文庫數位轉錄，未核底本影像","wikitext_sha256":"557274fb21e7041782d93622e5fc32d67cf56ed38d6f5a3994e238b60b9638d6","response_sha256":"4243cada96dbf78f0732f8facb678ff8a24a639f87d18592edd7b4ae2c9e2453","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"extraction_note":"僅移除段首縮排，不改正文異體、疑字或標點。","excerpts":[{"proposed_paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-phase5-pengcheng:phase6-line014","source_lines":[14,15],"raw_quote":"安平獻王孚，字叔達，宣帝次弟也。初，孚長兄朗字伯達，[[晉書/卷001|宣帝]]字仲達，孚弟馗字季達，恂字顯達，進字惠達，通字雅達，敏字幼達，俱知名，故時號為'''「八達」'''焉。孚溫厚廉讓，博涉經史。漢末喪亂，與兄弟處危亡之中，簞食瓢飲，而披閱不倦。性通恕，以貞白自立，未嘗有怨於人。陳留殷武有名於海內，嘗罹罪譴，孚往省之，遂與同處分食，談者稱焉。","raw_quote_sha256":"500c8ffe1ea2d99d15e16fddd2d6bc548efa5f1f02ffbfb5553ff153e32c618a","selected_text_sha256":"9614a72ca513f185c40464b625e888c4104f110cb1c51cfc67ac65a49fd8adbd","begin_anchor":"安平獻王孚，字叔達，宣帝次弟也。","end_anchor":"往省之，遂與同處分食，談者稱焉。"},{"source_lines":[100,100],"raw_quote":"彭城穆王權，字子輿，宣帝弟魏魯相東武城侯馗之子也。初襲封，拜冗從僕射。武帝受禪，封彭城王，邑二千九百戶。出為北中郎將、都督鄴城守諸軍事。泰始中入朝，賜袞冕之服。咸甯元年薨，子元王植立。歷位後將軍，尋拜國子祭酒、太僕卿、侍中、尚書。出為安東將軍、都督揚州諸軍事，代淮南王允鎮壽春，未發。或云植助允攻趙王倫，遂以憂薨。贈車騎將軍，增封萬五千戶。子康王釋立，官至南中郎將、持節、平南將軍，分魯國蕃、薛二縣以益其國，心二萬三千戶。薨，子雄立，坐奔蘇峻伏誅，更以釋子紘嗣。","raw_sha256":"478e3f93771c1ff000c00bd9ae03e56bd01e67dabd16ed7471e8937194ff10a4"}]}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADA","representative_source_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADA","source_person_ids":["dkn_ge4_286_AAADA"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAD","source_assertion_id":"a-phase5-037-權-father-馗","connection":"father","assembly_id":"family-sima-jun-near-ancestry","root_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false}}
